  <item>
    <title>E22 中秋仪式感：烧烤、吃田螺、溏心风暴…</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66e810633a5ff0a0cad1c487</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66e810633a5ff0a0cad1c487</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 16 Sep 2024 11:02:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🎑 🌕 🐇 🥮</span></p><span></span><p><span>又到一年中秋！</span></p><span></span><p><span>你也是这样吗？越大反而会越珍惜那些可以与家人呆在一起的节日（或者能够放假自己独处节日），比如说中秋节、新年，还独创了一些节日仪式感，走出日常忙碌的节奏，稍微hea（放松）一下。</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天我们就来闲聊属于我们的中秋仪式感，欢迎留言聊聊你的生活仪式感。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🕗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="40">00:40</a> abbie的近况</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="268">04:28</a> 关的近况</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">08:50</a> 一天用手机11个小时</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">09:45</a> 电脑中毒用户心得</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="805">13:25</a> 上一期拖更的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 中秋仪式感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="945">15:45</a> 时间过得越来越快的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 广东人烧烤的习惯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1195">19:55</a> 中秋吃鸡粥跟田螺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1215">20:15</a> 又怎么会少了溏心风暴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a> 手帐er的年度大事换本子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1495">24:55</a> 九月就是另一个新年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1555">25:55</a> 旅游收集外币</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1610">26:50</a> 主题约会晚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> 独处的Staycation</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a> 积极心理学</span></p><span></span><p><span>💬</span></p><span></span><p><span>「倾下偈」是 粤语 Chat Room（聊天室），和我们一起发现生活中的有趣灵感吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们是两位在异乡生活的广东女生，突发奇想做一档粤语的杂谈栏目，虽然每天的生活都很常规且忙碌，但我们依然想要将日常生活中的奇遇奇想与高光的瞬间聚集起来分享给大家。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🫧</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：Ride 岑宁儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>往期播客内容：</span><a href="http://usefulness.info/" data-url="http://usefulness.info/"><span>usefulness.info</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>🍠： </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/64e47e620000000001005ae9" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/64e47e620000000001005ae9"><span>@倾下偈（粤语）</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Newsletter：</span><a href="https://usefulness.zhubai.love/posts/2252851431210024960" data-url="https://usefulness.zhubai.love/posts/2252851431210024960"><span>生活的仪式感</span></a></p>]]></description>
