  <item>
    <title>E18 只有我吃粽子加糖吗？那些奇奇怪怪的生活癖好</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6649f31b82b428eafd9a497f</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6649f31b82b428eafd9a497f</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 19 May 2024 12:39:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>人生在世总有几个奇奇怪怪的小习惯。</span></p><span></span><p><span>比如 Kwen 说：“实不相瞒，我在毕业后去深圳工作后，才学会了“吃醋”，饺子蘸醋、炒米粉加醋、螺蛳粉加醋…..，还有一个在其他地区看起来更奇怪的癖好，是粽子加糖，每次吃都会被同事当作怪胎。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>还有 Abbie 说：“相比于正菜，我更喜欢旁边的配菜，比如虾饺我更喜欢虾饺皮。”</span></p><span></span><p><span>这次我们就聊聊一些奇奇怪怪的小癖好，欢迎留言跟我们分享你的独家小癖好～</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><code><span>时间轴</span></code></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="77">01:17</a> 来了深圳开始吃醋，连炒米粉都要加</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="183">03:03</a> 我能吃最大的辣是辛拉面的辣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="277">04:37</a> 汤饭是zui好吃的饭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="313">05:13</a> 河粉不是裸条啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="400">06:40</a> 颜控到更喜欢吃看上去颜色鲜艳的食物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="438">07:18</a> 吃葱会变聪明哦！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="560">09:20</a> 我真的get不到内脏的鲜甜味</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="723">12:03</a> 我特别钟情于配角</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="877">14:37</a> 打工人最爱预制菜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="920">15:20</a> 浓缩姜汁超好喝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1106">18:26</a> 自制配方奶茶推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1150">19:10</a> 书籍推荐《控糖革命》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1299">21:39</a> 旅行必备小癖好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1460">24:20</a> 长大之后觉得可以减少的消费</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1720">28:40</a> 去到哪里都要先收拾</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><code><span>节目介绍</span></code></p><span></span><p><span>「倾下偈」是 粤语 Chat Room（聊天室），和我们一起发现生活中的有趣灵感吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们是两位在异乡生活的广东女生，突发奇想做一档粤语的杂谈栏目，虽然每天的生活都很常规且忙碌，但我们依然想要将日常生活中的奇遇奇想与高光的瞬间聚集起来分享给大家。</span></p><span></span><p><span>-</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Pasadena-92914</span></p><span></span><p><span>Drunk-Keshi</span></p><span></span><p><span>往期播客内容：</span><a href="http://usefulness.info/" data-url="http://usefulness.info/"><span>usefulness.info</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>🍠： </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/64e47e620000000001005ae9" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/64e47e620000000001005ae9"><span>@倾下偈（粤语）</span></a></p>]]></description>
